  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would result in an inappropriate, obtrusive and disproportionate extension, which would obscure and impede views into, and the historical understanding of, the fives court site, thus causing harm to the character and appearance and the historic value of the existing dwelling. The proposed development would therefore be detrimental to the character, appearance, special interest and setting of the Grade II listed property, with no clear and convincing justification for the identified harm, nor public benefits to outweigh it, contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework (2021), policies D3.D(1) and (11) and HC1. C of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.B/D of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policies DM1 and DM7 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013). \r\n"
